{"reviewId": "311842999_8ao9pwHPE", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "好玄妙，之前看到60一个周期就想到中国的一甲子也是60年。玄学的很多预测也都很准，是不是我们都活在虚拟世界里，所以很多东西都是有规律的。\n康波周期和我之前看过的《原则》很类似，经济都是有周期的，本质上是人类的贪婪+资本主义造就的。大佬们的认知都是类似的。这本书是从《财富自由第一课》看过来的，那本书的作者是这本书作者的学生。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "11511-11585", "abstract": "太阳黑子周期的循环就是55～60年，20年一个海耳循环，20年中包含两个10年的施瓦贝循环，包含数个厄尔尼诺循环，所以厄尔尼诺就是经济中的库存周期。", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 23, "chapterName": "18 演讲实录：人生就是一场康波", "chapterIdx": 23, "reviewId": "311842999_8ao9pwHPE", "userVid": 311842999, "topics": [], "createTime": 1783308819, "userEditTime": 1783308982, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "18 演讲实录：人生就是一场康波", "author": {"userVid": 311842999, "name": "在路上", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/2EibCdXpbVLX69ISJiajBMA41yLbqNqhomcF6IttVS6suQrPHb3jibrnnCWAXpx3kKgYW35Hib7nCyzicmZrrVNibTaq1NDSGicc3kHhaVLHSicF3kQ/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "在路上", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "谦虚使人进步骄傲使人落后", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 3, "likes": [{"userVid": 18108288, "name": "Felicia", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0025-C4t_kt13_emTKClPE6nGqe6/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "Felicia", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20241216-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}], "